  "releaseNotes": "FluxMedia 1.1.6: fixes recording ownership, queue failure handling, final-state notifications and stop/disposal races. Improves GPU resource cleanup and diagnostic snapshots. Logging now uses LogConverge.Sharp 0.7.0, initialized by FluxEngine.Start, with fewer high-frequency and duplicate messages. Breaking changes: removes FluxMediaLog, its configuration and log-path APIs, PlaybackRecordingOptions.VideoBitrateKbps and VideoOutputCapabilities.DeviceUuid. FFmpeg.AutoGen 9.0.1.1; native libraries must match the selected binding ABI.",
